No warranty
Number Buddies is a free hobby project made by a parent. It is provided
"as is", without warranty of any kind, express or implied, including
fitness for a particular purpose. To the extent allowed by law, the author
is not liable for any loss or damage arising from its use. This repeats
Section 5 of the licence and does not limit any rights you have by law.

Fonts and outside code
The fonts (Andika, Fredoka), the Firebase code and the word-reading program
(Tesseract) are not part of this licence. They are loaded from their
providers and keep their own licences.

Privacy
Without an account, the app keeps everything on the device it runs on. If a
grown-up creates an optional free family account, the family's data is also
stored with Google Firebase. Opening the website contacts GitHub, Google and,
when reading a photo, jsDelivr. See privacy.html for the details.
